# Native model selection

Use the host's native model selection for the parent session, choosing the least
expensive capable tier without compromising correctness or safety. Subagents
inherit the parent's model; do not select or record per-track provider/model routes.

Full guidance: [`.agents/OPERATING.md` § 8 Native model selection](../../.agents/OPERATING.md).
